# hilavitkutin-build

Build-time optimisation crate. cfg emission, LLVM pass configuration,
PGO/BOLT workflows, pragma system. Used as `[build-dependencies]` by
hilavitkutin crates and consumers, whose build scripts call `configure`.
A consumer commits two files beside it: `.cargo/hilavitkutin-rustc-wrapper`,
the text `write_wrapper` writes, and `.cargo/config.toml` naming it as
`build.rustc-workspace-wrapper`. The flags reach the consumer's own
workspace members only, never its dependencies.
